    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0495_T07R0102_CeladonCity_DepartmentStore_2F_Text_LanceComesToBuyCapes",
      "en_US": [
        "We have a customer, Lance, who\n",
        "occasionally comes.\r",
        "He always buys capes.\r",
        "I wonder… Does he have many\n",
        "identical capes at home?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0495_T07R0102_PaintWorld_Text_FigureFirst",
      "en_US": [
        "… … …\r",
        "A figure made of paint turns to\n",
        "face you. It raises a brush."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0495_T07R0102_CeladonCity_DepartmentStore_2F_Text_FloorSign",
      "en_US": [
